  "description": {
   "en": "Ever since she was young, Haruno Mei has had the ability to see pink arrows that tell her which person someone loves. Following many hardships that came with this ability, Mei begins attending an all-girls' boarding school in the hopes of never getting involved with romance again. However, she discovers that her childhood friend Shirayuki Saya and her new classmate Fukatsu Rinna both have arrows pointing towards her.  \r\n  \r\nOfficial synopsis:   \r\n\"That actor and that idol are gonna get married, huh?\" I've gotten tired of saying that every time it happens since long ago, so I've stopped saying it lately.  \r\nHaruno Mei, a girl who is able to see who is in love with who, begins her new school life…",
   "fr": "“Cet acteur et cette idole vont se marier, hein ?” \nAu début, j'étais surprise de le deviner, mais maintenant, je préfère ne plus rien dire.\nHaruno Mei, une jeune fille capable de voir de qui chaque personne est amoureuse, commence une nouvelle vie dans son école.",
   "pt-br": "Desde que ela era jovem, Haruno Mei tem a capacidade de ver setas cor de rosa que dizem a ela qual pessoa alguém ama. Após muitas dificuldades que vieram com essa habilidade, Mei começa a frequentar um internato só para meninas na esperança de nunca mais se envolver com o romance. No entanto, ela descobre que sua amiga de infância Shirayuki Saya e seu novo colega de classe Fukatsu Rinna têm flechas apontando para ela."
  },
